            "text": "```json\n{\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Anti-Assignment\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"This Agreement and any rights or authority granted hereunder shall not be assigned or transferred by either Party, including by operation of law, merger or otherwise, without the express written consent of the other Party, provided that Licensor may assign this Agreement without consent to any of its Affiliates and Licensee may assign this Agreement without consent to SINA Leju or an Affiliate of Licensee that is controlled by SINA Leju.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"The parties acknowledge that the transfer of this Agreement to a successor entity in connection with a merger, consolidation, or the sale of all or substantially all of the assets or equity of a party constitutes a continuation of the existing contractual relationship and not an assignment, transfer or delegation for the purposes of this Agreement. The consent requirements set out in this Agreement have no application to any such transaction, and no notice to the other party is required in respect of it.\",\n      \"note\": \"Assignment requires express written consent, but exceptions permit assignment to specified affiliates without consent and exempt corporate reorganizations/mergers from assignment restrictions.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Change Of Control\",\n      \"characterization\": \"ABSOLUTE\",\n      \"quote\": \"Licensor may terminate this Agreement by providing prior written notice to Licensee upon the occurrence of a Change of Control.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": null,\n      \"note\": \"Licensor has the right to terminate the agreement upon written notice following a Change of Control without any stated exceptions.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Exclusivity\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"Subject to the terms and conditions of this Agreement, Licensor hereby grants to Licensee, and Licensee hereby accepts from Licensor, an exclusive, non-transferable (except as set forth in Section 10.7) and non-sublicensable (except as provided in Section 2.1(c)) license to use the Licensed Domain Names in connection with the Business during the Term.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"The parties acknowledge that any product, service, territory or customer relationship in existence as at the Effective Date lies outside the scope of the undertakings given under this Agreement in respect of exclusivity, restricted dealing, or minimum commitment. The continuation, renewal or expansion of any such arrangement by either party is permitted and shall not constitute a breach of this Agreement.\",\n      \"note\": \"The license grants exclusive rights to the domain names and content, but pre-existing arrangements in place as of the Effective Date are exempted from exclusivity undertakings.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
